OL,3,GNEWSAMajor gangland figure Steven
OL,4,ADaniel arrested in organised crime raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was arrested in connection with
OL,7,Fserious and organised crime, firearms
OL,8,Fand drugs offences as part of Operation
OL,9,FVentetic, a major UK-wide operation
OL,10,Fwhich has dismantled several gangs.
